IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. STUDENT.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-MARK1    PIC 9(3) VALUE 85.
01 WS-MARK2    PIC 9(3) VALUE 90.
01 WS-MARK3    PIC 9(3) VALUE 80.

01 WS-TOTAL    PIC 9(3).
01 WS-AVERAGE  PIC 9(3).
01 WS-GRADE    PIC X(10).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    COMPUTE WS-TOTAL =
        WS-MARK1 + WS-MARK2 + WS-MARK3

    COMPUTE WS-AVERAGE = WS-TOTAL / 3

    IF WS-AVERAGE >= 90
        MOVE "A GRADE" TO WS-GRADE
    ELSE
        IF WS-AVERAGE >= 75
            MOVE "B GRADE" TO WS-GRADE
        ELSE
            IF WS-AVERAGE >= 50
                MOVE "C GRADE" TO WS-GRADE
            ELSE
                MOVE "FAIL" TO WS-GRADE
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF

    DISPLAY "TOTAL: " WS-TOTAL
    DISPLAY "AVERAGE: " WS-AVERAGE
    DISPLAY "GRADE: " WS-GRADE

    STOP RUN.